 ation and will pilot it together with you\, our future students\, and Axel 
 Springer (AS) starting this fall semester.<br><br>In preparation\, please r
 ead <a href="https://wiki.code.berlin/display/CG/New+partner+and+new+type+o
 f+partnership%3A+Axel+Springer" id="ow1586" __is_owner="true">this wiki</a>
  page for more information.<br><br>We expect that you have a couple of ques
 tions\, which is why we invite&nbsp\;<b>you to a town hall meeting today at
  3pm.</b>&nbsp\;Please join us if you have any questions regarding this new
  partnership. Looking forward to seeing/hearing all of you.<br><br>────────
 ──<br><br>Britta Kiwit is inviting you to a scheduled Zoom meeting.<br><br>
