DESCRIPTION:\nRecommended for\nOrientation Semester/Core Semester\n\nAll ti
 mes this seminar is taking place\nThursday 13.09\, 13-17h\nThursday 20.09\,
  13-17h\n\nSign up/off deadline\nThursday 30.08\n\nLecturer\nMartin D.\n\nB
 lurb\nThis workshop will introduce you to Git and GitHub and let you experi
 ment on three basic challenges. Geared towards beginners or anyone curious 
 about the most popular distributed version control system.\n\nNo prior know
 ledge is required. Being able to navigate a terminal will make some of the 
 work easier but all steps will be explained step by step for people that ar
 e unfamiliar. \n\nThis workshop is an extended version of the workshop that
  took place in the Summer Camp (on 8.8.2018).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222711Z
