DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/event/evt-r3LlrmD0
 ORXX7OE?pk=g-Zdmm4FoPIaeXgD2\n\nClick to join: https://lu.ma/join/g-Zdmm4Fo
 PIaeXgD2\n\nEvent Information:\n\nLearn to make an app without code with us
 ! Bravo Studio is an app-building platform that turns your designs into nat
 ive mobile apps. Design freedom with no code. In this video\, Fergie (UX/UI
  designer & Adobe XD ambassador) will be building a simple App for Beginner
  Bravo Users using Adobe XD.\nThis workshop will also feature a fun design 
 challenge with prizes! Details will be dropping next week in our  Discord c
 ommunity . \n​-----------\n 🐰About our speaker\nBy day Fergie is Lead Expe
 rience Designer at ThoughtWorks\, building compelling digital offerings\, b
 ringing visions to life by building rich\, accessible products. She can als
 o be found on social media sharing design knowledge\, mentoring junior desi
 gners or live-streaming her design process whilst working on a project. Wit
 h a background in graphic and digital design\, Fergie has been in UX for ov
 er 11 years across too many industries to mention. Fergie's mission is to s
 upport junior designers and demystify the UX world.\nConnect with Fergie on
   Instagram \,  Behance \, and  YouTube ! \n-----------\n​​​​ 🐰 About Desi
 gn Buddies\n​​​​Design Buddies is an inclusive design community aimed to co
 nnect and empower designers by providing free resources\, events\, mentorsh
 ip\, and more.\n​​​​👋 Visit our  website  and hop into our  community !\n​
 ​​​🌟 Watch our  past events \, read our  blog \,  support us \, and connec
 t with us on  Instagram \,  Twitter \, and  LinkedIn  for more fun!\n​​​​Se
 e you here\, Every Bunny!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222710Z
LOCATION:https://lu.ma/join/g-Zdmm4FoPIaeXgD2
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Build apps with no code: Bravo Studio beginner masterclass - feat. 
 fun design challenge with prizes
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
