DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/event/evt-1QN9G4c5
 K7pRAxf?pk=g-VYPFIqNLRB8xn1D\n\nClick to join: https://lu.ma/join/g-VYPFIqN
 LRB8xn1D\n\nEvent Information:\n\nJoin us for an introduction to Spline and
  3D design for the web. We will learn how to use the tool and make an inter
 active 3D web scene that everyone can interact with. \n🎉 Giveaways\nWe wil
 l be giving away an M1 Macbook and 10 Spline pro subscriptions for submissi
 ons to a design challenge that will be revealed during the live event. \n👋
   Job opportunity\nSpline is hiring Product Designers\, 3D Designers\, and 
 Motion Designers. Send an email to jobs@spline.design and mention how you'r
 e from Design Buddies. \n-----------\n🐰 About Alejandro\nAlejandro Leon is
  the Founder of Spline. They love design\, development\, and building tools
 .\n-----------\n​​ 🐰 About Design Buddies\n​​​​​Design Buddies is an inclu
 sive design community aimed to connect and empower designers by providing f
 ree resources\, events\, mentorship\, and more.\n​​​​​👋 Visit our  website
   and hop into our  community !\n​​​​​🌟 Watch our  past events \, read our
   blog \, check our  shop \,  support us \, and connect with us on  Instagr
 am \,  Twitter \, and  LinkedIn  for more fun!\n​​​​​See you here\, Every B
 unny!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222036Z
