BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20181001T110000Z
DTEND:20181001T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20251202T224908Z
ORGANIZER;CN=no-reply@code.berlin:mailto:no-reply@code.berlin
UID:defd5d66-0f96-4016-9021-fe48175ee2cc
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=David 
 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
URL:https://wiki.code.berlin/display/ID/LU
CREATED:20181001T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAll times this LU is taking place\nMon 01.10. 13-17h \nFri 12
 .10. 09-13h \nFri 19.10. 09-13h \nFri 26.10. 09-13h\n\n\nLecturer\nDinko Ve
 rži\n\nBlurb\nThis learning unit complements ID 19 with emphasis on design.
  Using contemporary tools and methods\, students will then learn about the 
 basic and advanced aspects of responsive web design in theory and practice.
  Fundamental topics of screen design like grids\, typography and breakpoint
 s will be covered. Further\, we will practice designing more complex\, mult
 i-breakpoint responsive layouts and components\, e.g. forms\, navigations o
 r image galleries.\n\nLimited to 15 participants\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222311Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LU_11 Responsive Web Design
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
