ORGANIZER;CN=noreply@rainfocus.net:mailto:noreply@rainfocus.net
UID:prd.1661903922988001XWe5.1675728869898001VvRC.1658846gtcspring2023.nvid
 ia@rainfocus.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=David 
 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20230320T164819Z
DESCRIPTION:With the industrial metaverse\, digital twins\, and robotics wo
 rkflows\, the demand for 3D talent in non-entertainment industries has expl
 oded. Major automotive\, retail\, consumer goods\, telcommunications\, manu
 facturing\, energy\, and robotics companies are looking to hire and contrac
 t 3D talent. \n\nJoin NVIDIA and external artists coming from game developm
 ent\, visual effects\, and Hollywood animation backgrounds who will walk th
 rough how today's 3D creators can up their game and start an industrial met
 averse side hustle. We'll walk through how typical customer engagements occ
 ur\, what tools and resources NVIDIA has to support you\, and how NVIDIA ca
 n pair you with enterprise customers seeking 3D talent.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230320T164823Z
LOCATION:Please visit https://register.nvidia.com/flow/nvidia/gtcspring2023
 /attendeeportal/page/schedule to access your schedule. Sessions open 15 min
 utes prior to the scheduled start time.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:NVIDIA GTC Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
