DESCRIPTION:"Heh?! There is too much going on on Slack and Notion! I can't 
 keep up with things half the time! I wish there was someone to help!"\n\nLO
 OK NO FURTHER. Your amazing Student Lifecycle Team and Student Council are 
 here to save the day! (*gasp*) \n\nWe collect the latest news and present i
 t to you in this fun\, casual session which DOUBLES as a way to see each ot
 her's faces and play around together. The "info portion" will be the first 
 20 min or so\, and the "social portion" will take it from there. We'll go s
 ocialize in a fun\, virtual world...(we'll show you how to get into this my
 stical place in the session. No prep necessary.)\n\nI wish everyone who's s
 een Hamilton a day with this song stuck in your head (mwahaha!).\n\n-::~:~:
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~
 :~::-\nJoin Zoom Meeting\nhttps://codeuniversity.zoom.us/j/94672183324 (ID:
  94672183324)\n\nJoin by phone\n(DE) +49 30 56795800\n\nJoining instruction
 s: https://www.google.com/url?q=https://applications.zoom.us/addon/invitati
 on/detail?meetingUuid%3DGdFhqEYZTRiXolunkKLZfg%253D%253D%26signature%3D4a2a
 2286a0030fa312ceeb294614961f8356944570df16538c6739aa0b524424%26v%3D1&sa=D&s
 ource=calendar&usg=AOvVaw3HgfrVLc79W9qF6juk_5Sq\n\nPlease do not edit this 
 section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
