ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=RESOURCE;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=--4-Room
 y McRoomface (20);X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:code.berlin_3135303639333334323335@
 resource.calendar.google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=zz
 -event-group-link-8109576512;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:zz-event-group-link-8109
 576512@app.code.berlin
CREATED:20190121T135635Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you....\n- have trouble speaking in front of people?\n- suff
 er from nervousness?\n- lack confidence?\nIf yes\, this workshop is for you
 !\n\nSynergy is a wonderful thing. All the skills I have acquired as a prof
 essional singer\nand actor (over twenty years)\, and as a teacher of Busine
 ss English\, Voice and\nAlexander Technique\, have gone into the creation o
 f my workshop: Find Your\nAuthentic Voice.\n\nDuring the four-hour workshop
 \, we will uncover and explore your potential in order\nto bring the best y
 ou forward\, whether it be for your next presentation\, speech\, a\nmeeting
  or an interview. You will also learn proven techniques that not only help\
 nvocally and physically\, but also go a long way toward taming those pesky 
 nerves.\nJoin me on April 17th and get your Mind\, Breath\, Voice &amp\; Bo
 dy working as one so\nthat you can have an authentic and successful public 
 speaking experience. The\nworkshop will be informative and confidence build
 ing. I provide exercises that you\ncan take away with you and I encourage y
 ou to try everything we do in the workshop\nat home.\n\nNote: this is essen
 tially Presentation Skills Advanced level. You are especially well-prepared
  if you have done the Presentation Skills Basics workshop but all are welco
 me.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222033Z
LOCATION:--4-Roomy McRoomface (20)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:IS WS_02 Find Your Authentic Voice Workshop with Therese Pitt (Comm
 unications)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
