URL:https://wiki.code.berlin/display/ID/LU
CREATED:20181029T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAll times this LU is taking place\nMon 29.10. 15-19h \nWed 31
 .10. 15-19h \nMon 07.11. 15-19h\n\nLecturer\nHartmut Wöhlbier\n\nBlurb\nIoT
  is hot. But designing for it needs some knowledge of how things work and w
 hat is possible. I truly believe you need to build up a relationship toward
 s the medium you want to design for. Arduino is the ideal environment to st
 art building things and honor simple yet effective interactions way beyond 
 the screen. This is a beginner class. \n\nLimited to 10 participants\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222127Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LU_27 Arduino Intro
