URL:https://wiki.code.berlin/display/SE/SE+Sign+Up+List
CREATED:20180912T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:\nRecommended for\nOrientation Semester/Core Semester\n\nAll ti
 mes this seminar is taking place\nEvery Wednesday from 10-13h\, starting 12
 .09\n\nSign up/off deadline\nTuesday 11.9\, End of the day.\n\nLecturer\nAd
 am\, Ulrich\n\nBlurb\nCS50 will introduce you to the craft of computer prog
 ramming\, and to the academic disciple of Computer Science. It is an online
  course\, which we will accompany with weekly sessions.\n\nThis course repr
 esents a sizable commitment. Please carefully read through our Detailed inf
 ormation page.\n\nThe CS50 course is an excellent breadth course\, which ma
 ps neatly to our skills expected for the SE_01 module. Participating in the
  course is a very good way to get your skills up to speed\, and to prepare 
 for your final project for the SE_01 assessment. Note that you do not need 
 to take CS50 as part of the SE_01 standard assessment anymore.  \n\nInfo se
 ssion on 11 September 12:00 noon in Roomy. \n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222117Z
LOCATION:Roomy McRoomface
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SE_01 - CS50 Classroom
TRANSP:OPAQUE
