DESCRIPTION:Dear students and team\,&nbsp\;<br><br>after a poll via slack a
 nd another request in our last spirit day session\, we decided to continue 
 with this format\, but have it merged it with the general info sessions for
  students and only offering it once per month.<br><ul><li>the first 45 minu
 tes are a general update/information session</li><li>the 2nd 45 minutes wil
 l blow your minds away and are about interacting with each other - you can 
 join or leave both parts.</li></ul><br><br>If you are a student and want to
  bring up a bigger topic to discuss: please approach me (Britta) via slack 
 or mail to schedule you in.&nbsp\;<br><br>Looking forward to this session. 
 Note: The attendance is optional for everyone - team and students. Looking 
 forward to seeing you all anyway :D.
