BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20211101T160000Z
DTEND:20211101T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20251202T224908Z
ORGANIZER;CN=calendar-invite@lu.ma:mailto:calendar-invite@lu.ma
UID:evt-DV7UWKEwfXLonpK@events.lu.ma
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=David 
 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20211101T172755Z
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/event/evt-DV7UWKEw
 fXLonpK?pk=g-cn80OSUz3ghPZq0\n\nClick to join: https://lu.ma/join/g-cn80OSU
 z3ghPZq0\n\nEvent Information:\n\nJoin us at an interactive workshop using 
 Bravo Studio and Figma to make an app using no code! Karla will be showing 
 us how to build a simple blog app using Bravo\, Figma\, and Airtable. Bravo
  Studio is an app-building platform that turns your designs into native mob
 ile apps. \n​This workshop will also feature a fun design challenge with pr
 izes! Details will be dropping soon in our  Discord community .\n\n🐰 About
  our speaker\nKarla is a UX/UI & Digital Product Designer who creates custo
 m products that solve problems. She has designed\, built\, tested\, and pub
 lished 12 Apps on the App Store and Google Play Store as a Bravo Expert. \n
 Karla has started to advise students 3 years ago through Udacity and Intera
 ction Design Foundation (IDF). As of now\, she has trained dozens of studen
 ts mainly in North America\, Europe\, and Asia. She continues to mentor 1: 
 1 weekly SpringBoard students from Introduction to Design to UX/UI Design. 
 \nShe has created  Pratika & Vitamin K \, a program created to help people 
 bring their ideas to the market. The program teaches you the fundamentals o
 f problem-solving through Design Sprint\, uses real cases to show an overvi
 ew of the possibilities\, and provides the no-code tools necessary to bring
  products to life.\nConnect with Karla:  LinkedIn \,  LinkedIn (company) \,
  Twitter ( @pratikadesign \,  @karlafernandes )\,  Instagram \,  YouTube \,
   Website\n\n🐰 About Design Buddies\n​​​​​​​Design Buddies is an inclusive
  design community aimed to connect and empower designers by providing free 
 resources\, events\, mentorship\, and more.\n​​​​​​​👋 Visit our  website \
 , hop into our  community \, and subscribe to our  newsletter !\n​​​​​​​🌟 
 Watch our  past events \, read our  blog \,  support us \, and connect with
  us on  Instagram \,  Twitter \, and  LinkedIn  for more fun!\n​​​🎨Join us
  in style with our  custom zoom backgrounds  you may choose from\, too!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222649Z
LOCATION:https://lu.ma/join/g-cn80OSUz3ghPZq0
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Let's build an app using Bravo + Figma
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
