DESCRIPTION:<br><b>ROOM BOOKED: Swift (2.9.3)</b><br>Hi <b>folks</b>! Let's
  start the week with a short review of the main issues or bumps we may have
  found these last days of work for the project. As far as I know everything
  seems to be fine and we are aiming towards testing this Tuesday. Hopefully
  by then all the screen designs are finished and implemented. Please before
  this meeting let's update each other on Slack to know if we are struggling
  with something and how can we all offer support or just to give us all a f
 eeling of being in the same page.&nbsp\;<br><br>Roland\, our coach\, will b
 e with us for this meeting. We will have the chance to ask him for feedback
  and explain how did we organised ourselves by team departments.&nbsp\;<br>
 <br>Looking forward to it!&nbsp\;<br><br>PS:&nbsp\; We are registered at th
 e Expo as :<br><b><br></b><br><b>Factory Royale : Fund Fun!&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</
 b><br><b><br></b><br><b>4-player-arcade-style-platform</b><b>-game inspired
  on the Factory and the entrepreneurship world with 4 diverse characters re
 presenting CODE students battling for funding for their first Start Ups.</b
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222652Z
LOCATION:CODE University of Applied Sciences\, Lohmühlenstraße 65\, 12435 B
 erlin\, Germany
