 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
URL:https://wiki.code.berlin/display/ID/LU
CREATED:20181005T070000Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAll times this LU is taking place\nFri 05.10. 09-15h \nFri 19
 .10. 09-15h\n\n\nLecturer\nMartin Knobel\n\nBlurb\nThe term UX (user experi
 ence) is still on vogue. But what actually is an experience? Why create an 
 experience and what is important when doing so? Past experiences are meanin
 gful and sustainable. Even more\, they define who we are. Is it possible to
  create real experiences out of technology?\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222030Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LU_52 Experience Design
TRANSP:OPAQUE
