DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/event/evt-Nsg2oesE
 31ngTM5?pk=g-FFx0ZXEKWFVIZvd\n\nClick to join: https://lu.ma/join/g-FFx0ZXE
 KWFVIZvd\n\nEvent Information:\n\nJoin us to see what our Buddies have made
  in 3D using Spline\, and we will be revealing our winners. It could be you
  👀  Don't worry if you missed our workshop earlier\, there's still time to
  submit! \n🎉 Giveaways (still open to enter until 8/3\, 11:59 pm PT)\nWe w
 ill be giving away an M1 Macbook and 10 Spline pro subscriptions for submis
 sions to a design challenge that will be revealed during the live event. \n
 If you missed our event\, you can still watch  our recording \, follow alon
 g\, and submit! \nChallenge details\, due 8/3\, 11:59 pm PT:  https://airta
 ble.com/shr03lbJzxHCgv4ra\nWe would also love to see your creations in our 
  🐰#🌈spline-3d-challenge  channel on  Discord  and on social media (Instag
 ram\, Twitter\, and LinkedIn)! Tag Design Buddies and Spline\, include  #Sp
 line3DBuddies  so we can see and re-share your work ✨\n👋  Job opportunity\
 nSpline is hiring Product Designers\, 3D Designers\, and Motion Designers. 
 Send an email to jobs@spline.design and mention how you're from Design Budd
 ies. \n-----------\n🌈 About Spline\nSpline is a 3D tool for web experience
 s.  Download Spline here  (free) and  view more documentation ! Connect wit
 h Spline on  Twitter \,  Instagram \,  YouTube  (feat. tutorials)\, and  Ti
 ktok !\n-----------\n🐰 About Design Buddies\n​​​​​Design Buddies is an inc
 lusive design community aimed to connect and empower designers by providing
  free resources\, events\, mentorship\, and more.\n​​​​​👋 Visit our  websi
 te  and hop into our  community !\n​​​​​🌟 Watch our  past events \, read o
 ur  blog \,  support us \, and connect with us on  Instagram \,  Twitter \,
  and  LinkedIn  for more fun!\nSee you here\, Every Bunny!
