 vid.caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20220817T100931Z
DESCRIPTION:Mental Health is for everyone\, whether you’re having a stressf
 ul time right now or not! Andrew shares lessons learned from therapy about 
 attention and focus - how they can affect school or work\, what excessive o
 r intrusive thinking can look like\, and tips on how to improve focus\, men
 tal health\, and well-being. This session is not a replacement for therapy\
 , but a sharing of best practices and lessons from 13 years of pursuing men
 tal health!\n\nThis is going to be a hybrid session\, a Zoom link will be a
 dded!\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin Zoom Meeting\nhttps://codeuniversity.zoom.us/j/
 91929226901?pwd=RG5oZjF6ZHh5cEExMG5uK2lLUC80Zz09 (ID: 91929226901\, passcod
 e: 965611)\n\nJoin by phone\n(DE) +49 69 38079884 (passcode: 965611)\n(US) 
 +1 646-931-3860 (passcode: 965611)\n\nJoining instructions: https://www.goo
 gle.com/url?q=https://applications.zoom.us/addon/invitation/detail?meetingU
 uid%3DPNNOHfr1Rq6leHgRY3of3A%253D%253D%26signature%3D0108998ce244a703513f61
 5f0783ea8332a212b673f201be0e27f41dcf39e913%26v%3D1&sa=D&source=calendar&usg
 =AOvVaw0FZuqW7qQCRQqEzj6f-TTp\n\nMeeting host: paulina.steffen@code.berlin<
 br /><br />Join Zoom Meeting: <br /><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=h
 ttps://codeuniversity.zoom.us/j/91929226901?pwd%3DRG5oZjF6ZHh5cEExMG5uK2lLU
 C80Zz09&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2H5rn54DKlFPcfiijX_bL
 j" target="_blank">https://codeuniversity.zoom.us/j/91929226901?pwd=RG5oZjF
 6ZHh5cEExMG5uK2lLUC80Zz09</a>\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::
