 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20230320T164830Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the Adobe Substance 3D team as they break down the process
  of creating “End of Summer\,” an inspiring 3D project completed using NVID
 IA Omniverse\, Unreal Engine 5\, and the Substance 3D Collection in an end-
 to-end Universal Scene Description (USD) pipeline. Discover key workflow hi
 ghlights including the team’s creative approach\, how they used cutting-edg
 e 3D tools and techniques\, and the benefits of using USD in collaborative 
 3D projects. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230320T164834Z
