 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
URL:https://wiki.code.berlin/display/ID/LU
CREATED:20181024T070000Z
DESCRIPTION:\nAll times this LU is taking place\nWed 24.10. 09-13h \nWed 07
 .11. 09-13h\n\nLecturer\nMartin Knobel\n\nBlurb\nWhen working on an interac
 tive environment instead of on a digital product\, different aspects are cr
 ucial for success. First\, how to explore the new freedom in design\, how t
 o create a story for the experience emerging in the environment. Furthermor
 e\, how to take different paths while interacting with your design. It is i
 mportant to prototype this beforehand. But how to prototype an environment?
  With this learning unit\, you to get started in that field.\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222630Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LU_46 Play with Interactive Environments
TRANSP:OPAQUE
