DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Demo Day 11! The theme: FinTech & SaaS!\n\nThis even
 t is very special to us for a few reasons:\n\n**1.** DDVs! DDVs! DDVs! DDVs
 ! -- Each startup on Stonks now has a DDV (Demo Day Vehicle)\, which is kin
 d of like an RUV but built-in to the platform 🤓\n\n**2.** This event is th
 e platform's anniversary celebration. We launched the Stonks platform at th
 e end of September\, 2021 🍾🍾🍾\n\n**3.** After a brief hiatus\, startup i
 nvesting is BACK in full force. We just had our best month ever in terms of
  helping startups raise and Q4 is looking amazing.\n\n**Panelists:**\n\n**E
 than Kurzweil -** Bessemer Venture Partners\n\n\n**Vanessa Larco -** New En
 terprise Associates\n\n\n**???????? -** ????????????****\n\nCome join the f
 un (and the fund) and check out 6 amazing startups that hope to bring in in
 vestment LIVE (including a potential check from the Best of Stonks Fund) to
  finish their rounds 💰\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo join the event click here: https://
 stonks.com/dd/11
LAST-MODIFIED:20221006T182643Z
