DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the <strong>Generative AI Mastermind Kickoff Call</s
 trong>!<br><br>In this session\, we’ll cover everything you need to get sta
 rted and make the most of your 2-day learning experience starting from 25th
 -26th January.<br><h3>Agenda:</h3><ul><li><strong>Overview of the Mastermin
 d Schedule🗓️</strong>: A detailed walkthrough of the sessions\, topics\, a
 nd key takeaways.<br><br></li><li><strong>Expectation Setting</strong>: Cla
 rifying goals\, outcomes\, and what you can expect from this program.<br><b
 r></li><li><strong>Logistics Setup🛠️</strong>: Guidance on accessing key p
 latforms – <b>Whatsapp</b>\, <strong>GrowthSchool LMS</strong>\, and syncin
 g with <strong>Google Calendar</strong> for seamless event reminders.<br><b
 r></li><li><strong>Onboarding Form🧑‍💻</strong>: Complete the onboarding p
 rocess to personalize your learning experience.<b> <a href="https://docs.go
 ogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdZ7kBKTJQ_OjHSUxJlT_MAXZOiHz2SoF1w6IfLvW-seKt0EA
 /viewform?usp=send_form" target="_blank"><u>Link</u></a><br></b><br></li><l
 i><strong>Speed Networking &amp\; Team building🤝</strong>: Get to know you
 r fellow participants in an interactive networking session &amp\; build you
 r <b>Team for the next 2 days</b><br><br></li><li><strong>Q&amp\;A</strong>
 : Open the floor for any questions or clarifications.</li></ul><p>This call
  will ensure you’re fully prepared and equipped for an incredible learning 
 journey ahead.</p><p>Looking forward to seeing you there!</p>
