 caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20181128T044802Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>As a fully-inclusive international university\, CODE aims t
 o make all of our students and staff feel welcomed\, integrated\, and suppo
 rted on campus. Therefore the official language at CODE is and always has b
 een English.<br><br><br><b>Agenda</b>:<br>After a discussion with the stude
 nt council we decided to have an open conversation with all students about 
 the new rules in a big townhall meeting/Allhands. This way we don't want to
  confront you with strict rules but give you the chance to shape them with 
 us\, ask questions and explain why it is important that everyone speaks eng
 lish.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222613Z
LOCATION:Kitchen Area\, 4th floor
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Townhall Meeting w all students / English speaking rules
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
