CREATED:20190730T133544Z
DESCRIPTION:On <b>Wednesday\, September 4th from 5.30pm until 7.30pm\, all 
 clubs and initiatives teams will be on campus</b> to explain what they are 
 doing. That’s the chance to talk to them and find out if you would like to 
 join them.<br><br><br><b>Clubs and Initiatives and the rooms:</b><br>//Slas
 h - Scissors<br>unicon - Roomy<br>Studis for Future - Morty<br>Art &amp\; C
 ode - Peace<br>esports - Jungle (not active at the moment\, but looking for
  member who want to start something)<br>Science Club - Amy Farrah Fowler<br
 >Football &amp\; Climbing - Rock (if you have more ideas for sport clubs\, 
 join them!)<br>New ideas - Spock (+the new rooms if you have an concrete id
 ea)
