 ttps://codeuniversity.slack.com/archives/C53K4L88M/p1574849147017300)</p><p
 ><br></p><p>Let's come together to find out how Bosch\, a company with more
  than 400k employees\, tackles the broad and essential topic diversity. Wha
 t does diversity mean to Bosch? Why do they think it's important? What conc
 rete are they doing?</p><p>Barb will interview Ann-Kathrin and Bernhard\, t
 wo diversity experts from Bosch.&nbsp\;</p><p>And\, of course\, let's celeb
 rate our new partnership!</p>
