DESCRIPTION:Join from a PC\, Mac\, iPad\, iPhone or Android device:<br>&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Please click this URL to join. <a href="https://us0
 6web.zoom.us/j/85943280914">https://us06web.zoom.us/j/85943280914</a><br><b
 r>Description:&nbsp\;<br><br>Up until recently\, the majority of commercial
  and government-led digital identity systems have been federated\, where a 
 small group of “identity providers” supply their customers or citizens with
  a digital identity that can be used to access other websites and services 
 within the federation. Now we’re seeing the shift to decentralized identity
  solutions and open ecosystems based on verifiable credentials\, where anyo
 ne can participate\, issue\, and verify.<br><br>In the first of a new serie
 s on digital identity and government\, we’ll examine digital identity syste
 ms within the public sector and the reasons why government interest in dece
 ntralized models keeps increasing.<br><br>Presented by:<br>- Andy Tobin\, E
 MEA Managing Director at Evernym<br>- Drummond Reed\, Chief Trust Officer a
 t Evernym<br><br>Or One tap mobile:<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;+1253215
 8782\,\,85943280914# US (Tacoma)<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;+1346248779
 9\,\,85943280914# US (Houston)<br><br>Or join by phone:<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;Dial(for higher quality\, dial a number based on your current l
 ocation):<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;US: +1
  253 215 8782  or +1 346 248 7799  or +1 669 900 6833  or +1 312 626 6799  
 or +1 646 558 8656  or +1 301 715 8592 <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Russia: +7 499 951 6380  or +7 812 426 8988  or +7 
 495 283 9788  or +7 499 951 6379 <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;United Kingdom: +44 330 088 5830  or +44 131 460 1196  or
  +44 203 481 5237  or +44 203 481 5240  or +44 203 901 7895  or +44 208 080
  6591  or +44 208 080 6592 <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Webinar ID: 859 
 4328 0914<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;International numbers available: <
 a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/u/kcPJE8WwQV">https://us06web.zoom.us/u/kcP
 JE8WwQV</a>
