DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/event/evt-zKdtWYqf
 UyXCj14?pk=g-8bh1WSdjhK9dbxj\n\nClick to join: https://lu.ma/join/g-8bh1WSd
 jhK9dbxj\n\nEvent Information:\n\nIn this interactive event\, we will talk 
 about how virtual worlds can be the next medium to deliver immersive portfo
 lio for designers\, photographer\, & story tellers.\n\n🐰About our speakers
 \nSonya Seddarasan is a Sr. principal product designer & an HCI practitione
 r for about 12 years now. With a history of working in the different indust
 ry\, she aims to build products which make a difference. She is currently b
 uilding a UPWorlds ✨🚀- a peer to peer marketplace for metaverse builders c
 ommunity.\nConnect with Sonya: Twitter\nConnect with Upworlds: Twitter\, Li
 nkedIn\, Website\n— \nPierre-Francois Gerard (MetaPierre) is co-founder at 
 Metaxu.studio a VR design practice which strives to enhance people's spatia
 l abilities through immersive design approach and virtual reality. Pierre b
 uilt his first 3D graphical interface as part of his master in architecture
 . A couple of decades of design\, 3D visualisation and research later\, as 
 a self describe VRchitect\, he is designing virtual worlds and events in co
 llaboration with artists\, performers and designers.\nConnect with Metaux s
 tudio (all links)\n\n​​​​​​​🐰 About Design Buddies\n​​​​​​​Design Buddies 
 is an inclusive design community aimed to connect and empower designers by 
 providing free resources\, events\, mentorship\, and more.\n​​​​​​​👋 Visit
  our website\, hop into our community\, and subscribe to our newsletter!\n​
 ​​​​​​🌟 Watch our past events\, read our blog\, support us\, and connect w
 ith us on Instagram\, Twitter\, Tik Tok\, and LinkedIn for more fun!\n🎨Joi
 n us in style with our custom zoom backgrounds you may choose from\, too!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222135Z
LOCATION:https://lu.ma/join/g-8bh1WSdjhK9dbxj
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Build your immersive portfolio using virtual worlds
