DESCRIPTION:### [Equi ](https://www.equi.com/)is building technology to ide
 ntify and provide access to the world's top undiscovered hedge funds and pr
 ivate credit opportunities. Read about them in [TechCrunch](https://techcru
 nch.com/2022/03/29/equi-is-building-a-family-office-for-non-billionaires/).
 \n\n### Equi is on track to be one of the fastest growing invest-tech platf
 orms in history.\n\n### The previous Seed round of $10M was highly competit
 ive and almost 3x oversubscribed.\n\n### It included funds like Foundation 
 Capital\, Hustle Fund\, Leo Polovets (Susa Ventures)\, Draft Ventures\, F7 
 Ventures\, Gaingels\, Calm Ventures\, Hyper\, Packy McCormick\, Anthony Pom
 pliano\, and executives/founders from Loom\, Carta\, Thumbtack\, Robinhood.
 \n\n### This round is led by Montage Ventures - their portfolio includes br
 eakout fintech investments like MoneyLion\, HomeLight\, EasyKnock\, and man
 y others.\n\nTo join the event click here: https://stonks.com/dd/equi
