DESCRIPTION:Join us for this virtual event for an afternoon of fun and expe
 rt guidance as you learn how to present your design work in a compelling wa
 y. Talking about your own work is hard\, which is why we'll show you how to
  present your work\, explain what good portfolios look like\, and give you 
 some top tips on how to tell the story behind the work.This is an invite on
 ly event for students who are studying and have an interest in digital desi
 gn fields. When: 24th June 2020Time: 4:00pm-5:15pm GMT.
