DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://lu.ma/notioninberlin?pk=
 g-gKzAqUJKwQTMrET\n\nAddress:\nTaxfix GmbH\n\nMake your way over on 27/10 t
 o join us for for a gathering of the Notion Community in Berlin. We'll have
  40 Notion Ambassadors from all across Europe joining us for this special g
 athering along with a handful of Notion team members. We're excited to brin
 g our local community together in a fun way to connect and learn from one a
 nother.\nThank you to Taxfix for generously hosting us!\n5:00 PM - 5:30 PM:
  Doors open\, grab food/drinks\n5:30 PM - 5:40 PM: Welcome from Notion Team
 \n5:40 PM - 6:15 PM: Panel with Notion Ambassadors\n6:15 PM - 6:30 PM: Brea
 k out into groups - grab food/drinks\n6:30 PM - 7:00 PM: Breakout groups\n7
 :00PM - 8:00PM: Networking + connecting with community\nSpace is very limit
 ed so be sure to sign up ASAP. We can’t wait to see you there!\nPlease note
  the event will be in English. This event will not be recorded.
LAST-MODIFIED:20231010T142106Z
LOCATION:Taxfix GmbH\, Köpenicker Str. 122\, 10179 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
