CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20200210T134846Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Next week we will be joined by the <i>Vice President and Glo
 bal Head of Enabling of the Bosch Center for Artificial Intelligence</i> -&
 nbsp\;<strong>Martin Thomas</strong>.&nbsp\;</p><p>He will share his insigh
 ts and experience in the field of Artificial Intelligence and tell us about
  his role at Bosch's Centre for Artificial Intelligence.&nbsp\;</p><p>There
 after\, CODE's very own Florencia Noriega\, Sebastian Rosengrün and Elias W
 olf will partake in a Fireside Chat with Martin Thomas\, &nbsp\;moderated b
 y Frank Trollmann.&nbsp\;</p><p><i>Make sure to RSVP on the Learning Platfo
 rm! Drinks and snacks will be provided</i></p><p><b>Looking forward to seei
 ng you all at the Partner &amp\; Projects first event of 2020!&nbsp\;</b></
 p><p><b>Event Agenda:&nbsp\;</b></p><p><b><i>17:00</i></b></p><p>Bosch Team
  arrive</p><p><b><i>17:15&nbsp\;</i></b></p><p>Grab a drink and find a seat
 </p><p><b><i>17:30&nbsp\;</i></b></p><p>Official start of event&nbsp\;</p><
 p>Talk given by Martin Thomas&nbsp\;</p><p><b><i>18:15</i></b></p><p>Short 
 break. Grab another drink and more snacks - get ready for the Fireside chat
 !&nbsp\;</p><p><b><i>18:30</i></b></p><p>Fireside Chat starts</p><p>Martin 
 Thomas\, Florencia Noriega\, Sebastian Rosengrün\, Elias Wolf\, moderated b
 y Frank Trollmann</p><p><b><i>19:15&nbsp\;</i></b></p><p>Official end of ev
 ent&nbsp\;</p><p><b><i>19:20</i></b></p><p>Time to mingle! Meet the Bosch t
 eam and enjoy the rest of the evening</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222104Z
LOCATION:in front of Scissors
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:P&P Event 01: Bosch A.I. Fireside Chat
TRANSP:OPAQUE
