ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=David 
 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20230320T164502Z
DESCRIPTION:Building virtual worlds such as digital twins of factories\, wa
 rehouses\, or city streets is an extremely involved and technical process f
 or today’s technical artists and can take months to complete. NeRFs (Neural
  Radiance Fields) can accelerate this process by scanning the real world in
 to our virtual worlds\, and we can further speed things up by employing Gen
 erative AI techniques to create objects and materials from scratch. \n \nJo
 in this session to see some of NVIDIA’s latest work in Generative AI and Ne
 RFs for building virtual worlds in NVIDIA Omniverse.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230320T164504Z
LOCATION:Please visit https://register.nvidia.com/flow/nvidia/gtcspring2023
 /attendeeportal/page/schedule to access your schedule. Sessions open 15 min
 utes prior to the scheduled start time.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:NVIDIA GTC Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
