 vid.caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20201211T144247Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><span>Dear fellows\,<br></span></p><p><span>I hope you made 
 it through the assessment phase and can shape your upcoming winter break to
  have a fun and cheerful time.<br></span></p><p><span>We\, the Student Coun
 cil\, assemble you to this general assembly as <b>there are required change
 s to the Statute of the student body</b>. The Student General Assembly will
  be on the 18.12.2020 from 2pm onwards.</span><br></p><p><span>For this mee
 ting the following points are currently on the agenda:</span></p><ol><li><s
 pan> Discussion of the statue (</span><a href="https://docs.google.com/docu
 ment/d/1P6leV1byvdRTUsYf0lB41ZFxxht7e_IOUO5_zt2keI8" id="ow919" __is_owner=
 "true"><span>found here</span></a><span>)\, discussing possible amendments 
 to it and voting on the statute and amendments.<br><br></span><span></span>
 </li><li><span><span><span><span>Discussion of the rules of procedure (</sp
 an><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iKkU9ThCq5cJarimz8wQOU62QKU
 QIaqaVDVUqK-jxD8/edit?usp=sharing" id="ow932" __is_owner="true"><span>found
  here</span></a><span>)\, discussing possible amendments to it and voting o
 n the rules of procedure and amendments.</span></span></span></span></li></
 ol><p><span>Changes to the Statute are required to be voted on by the stude
 nt body\, which deems at least 10% of the student body present and particip
 ating in the vote necessary. <br><br></span></p><p><span>Therefore\, <b>ple
 ase attend to this quick assembly if you can make it. </b><br><br></span></
 p><p><span>See you soon!<br></span></p>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin Zoom Meeting\
 nhttps://codeuniversity.zoom.us/j/92050938857 (ID: 92050938857)\n\nJoin by 
 phone\n(DE) +49 69 71049922\n\nJoining instructions: https://www.google.com
 /url?q=https://applications.zoom.us/addon/invitation/detail?meetingUuid%3Df
 21JYR5DRVCjm6TLNk%252BPmg%253D%253D%26signature%3D1ad428f6dc753446431c9a0ea
 ce3992505db3a4ba6f0e624c8fb0c70df010817&sa=D&source=calendar&usg=AOvVaw36G6
 VGdiiQpqIYIJ_JiGu9\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~
