 t to you in this fun\, casual session which DOUBLES as a way to see each ot
 her's faces and play around together. The "info portion" will be the first 
 20 min or so\, and the "social portion" will take it from there. We'll go s
 ocialize in a fun\, virtual world...(we'll show you how to get into this my
 stical place in the session. No prep necessary.)\n\nI wish everyone who's s
 een Hamilton a day with this song stuck in your head (mwahaha!).\n\n-::~:~:
