DESCRIPTION:Folks\, let's have a mixed get together / hands-on-work and sha
 re breakfast while we have an informal meeting. Please bring along breakfas
 t items so we can all share. Also bear in mind team members food allergies\
 , such as celiac. (fruits\, chia puddings would be ok\, gluten free items b
 asically) This can be also our chance to have a more relaxed and fun meetin
 g while we bridge together the design with the actual game. \nThis will be 
 our last chance to meet all together this week\, since Friday seems busy fo
 r most of us and next Monday - Tuesday we should be ready to test until pre
 sentation. \n\nLets meet on the kitchen of the first floor to prepare the b
 reakfast and start rolling! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222216Z
LOCATION:CODE University of Applied Sciences\, Lohmühlenstraße 65\, 12435 B
 erlin\, Germany
