DESCRIPTION:This is an info session for the Amendments voted on at the Stud
 ent General Assembly on September 3rd. Please refer to the following Slack 
 post for more information: https://codeuniversity.slack.com/archives/CFD01M
 VMK/p1629307542004000 \n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin Zoom Meeting\nhttps://codeuniv
 ersity.zoom.us/j/93502861493 (ID: 93502861493)\n\nJoin by phone\n(DE) +49 6
 9 38079884\n\nJoining instructions: https://www.google.com/url?q=https://ap
 plications.zoom.us/addon/invitation/detail?meetingUuid%3DD2kMTXj5S4aDZbJyOB
 USVQ%253D%253D%26signature%3Dd6baf4a8483b074d07a507b485849953064947fa5772a4
 1bec811c8c5f17f38b%26v%3D1&sa=D&source=calendar&usg=AOvVaw0GG9iuzVNGY_pU_RL
 C0Irp\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
