BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20251013T160000Z
DTEND:20251013T161500Z
DTSTAMP:20251202T224908Z
ORGANIZER;CN=Laurin Notemann:mailto:laurin.notemann@code.berlin
UID:0m92iq46eeh5mil6jfdg9j1e8h@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=david.
 caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/gvt-gobr-ruz
CREATED:20251009T131456Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br>Hey Everyone. [<b>Mandatory ATTENDANCE ONLINE 13.10
  18-18:15</b>]<br>During and after our last General Assembly\, in which we 
 voted in favor of the new Statute\, we received feedback that the removal o
 f Female and Male council positions could lead to misrepresentation of gend
 ers in the SC. <br><br><b>What changes:<br></b><br>There are <b>TWO </b>new
  proposals. <br>1. Adding a new Portfolio: Representation &amp\; Equity (fi
 nd the details here: <a href="https://github.com/codeuniversity/student-cou
 ncil/pull/15">https://github.com/codeuniversity/student-council/pull/15</a>
 ) <br>2. Introducing a new Safeguard to ensure Flinta representation (find 
 the details here: <a href="https://github.com/codeuniversity/student-counci
 l/pull/17">https://github.com/codeuniversity/student-council/pull/17</a>)<b
 r><br>The second proposal is dependent on the first proposal. <b>This means
  that if the second proposal is accepted\, the first proposal is also autom
 atically accepted.</b><br><br><b>PLEASE GIVE FEEDBACK BY CLICKING ON THE LI
 NK AND COMMENTING.</b><br><b>Agenda of the Assembly:</b><br>1. Additions to
  the agenda by other Students<br>2. Quick intro of the changes<br>3. Vote o
 n the two changes separately<br><br>If you have comments about these change
 s\, please make these at least 2 hours <b>BEFORE</b> the assembly. Everythi
 ng afterwards will not be taken into consideration for the amendment\, exce
 pt for discussion purposes.I understand that this is very last minute\, how
 ever we must hold the election<b> BEFORE THE END OF OCTOBER</b> and therefo
 re these changes need to happen <b>ASAP.</b>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Goo
 gle Meet: https://meet.google.com/gvt-gobr-ruz\nOr dial: (DE) +49 40 808161
 6552 PIN: 212824893#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/gvt-gobr-ruz?pin
 =6239924648588&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com
 /a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
