DESCRIPTION:\nRecommended for\n\nCore Semester\n\nAll times this seminar is
  taking place - PRELIMINARY!\nThursday 13.09.\, 09 - 13h\nbi-weekly on Thu\
 n\nLecturer\nBarb\, Eva\, Florian + external speakers\n\nFrequency\nevery W
 T\n\nBlurb\n\n\nCommunication is key for a PM. The students will learn to c
 ommunicate clearly and efficiently with stakeholders\, the team\, managemen
