 07ee@group.calendar.google.com:mailto:c_723d6a6a122d1f91682b6aa468524fde466
 cdafa562e9bd53b37f08213a007ee@group.calendar.google.com
UID:6i3qghv6flmnv8pd5rgihtbril@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=da
 vid.caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20250123T084129Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Welcome to the <b>Generative AI Mastermind Kickoff Call</b>!
 </p><p>In this session\, we’ll cover everything you need to get started and
  make the most of your 2-day learning experience starting from 25th-26th Ja
 nuary.</p><h3><b>Agenda:</b></h3><ul><li><p><b>Overview of the Mastermind S
 chedule🗓️</b>: A detailed walkthrough of the sessions\, topics\, and key t
 akeaways.<br></p></li><li><p><b>Expectation Setting</b>: Clarifying goals\,
  outcomes\, and what you can expect from this program.<br></p></li><li><p><
 b>Logistics Setup🛠️</b>: Guidance on accessing key platforms – <b>Whatsapp
 </b>\, <b>GrowthSchool LMS</b>\, and syncing with <b>Google Calendar</b> fo
 r seamless event reminders.<br></p></li><li><p><b>Onboarding Form🧑‍💻</b>:
  Complete the onboarding process to personalize your learning experience.<b
 > </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdZ7kBKTJQ_OjHSUxJl
 T_MAXZOiHz2SoF1w6IfLvW-seKt0EA/viewform?usp=send_form" target="_blank"><u><
 b><u>Link</u></b><b><u><br></u></b></u></a></p></li><li><p><b>Speed Network
 ing &amp\; Team building🤝</b>: Get to know your fellow participants in an 
 interactive networking session &amp\; build your <b>Team for the next 2 day
 s</b><b><br></b></p></li><li><p><b>Q&amp\;A</b>: Open the floor for any que
