ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=david.
 caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20190227T150508Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b>The World's Largest Developers&nbsp\;Conference ...</b><
 br><b><br></b><br>Let’s be honest: attending workshops can be dull. BUT – n
 ot here\, not with us\, not with WeAreDevelopers! We combine expert knowled
 ge with entertainment and industry know-how to deliver the workshops that w
 ill allow you to<br><ul><li><b>Improve your skills</b><br></li><li><b>Deep-
 dive into new realities</b><br></li><li><b>Learn from the best</b><br></li>
 <li><b>Rise to new levels!</b><br></li></ul><br>Join us at WeAreDevelopers 
 and experience bleeding-edge workshops!<br><br><a href="https://events.wear
 edevelopers.com" target="_blank">https://events.wearedevelopers.com</a><br>
 <br>The Congress will focus on human-machine interactions and will bring to
 gether two sides: The academy and the industry. We will try to answer quest
 ions such as: Can we trust computer decisions? How to deal with decisions b
 ias? How can we improve the user experience for machine learning software? 
 And many\, many more.<br><br>Want to showcase your work at the CODE Booth: 
 Sign up <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdDoITFNkXs-e5W1P
 CMvF9-klUDS3H_bLNrugf9H8V6k5Dq2g/viewform" target="_blank">here</a>&nbsp\;<
 br><br><br>CODE Staff:<br>6th: Jana /Emilia<br>7th: Emilia <u></u><u></u>/ 
 Fran<u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230914T095557Z
LOCATION:CityCube Berlin\, Messedamm 26\, 14055 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:WeAreDevelopers WorldCongress 2019
