 i>The Faculty Fair takes place from 1 pm to 5 pm on campus.</li><li>It is a
  kind of reverse expo day where faculty presents to students what happens i
 n the coming semester</li><li>Every member of faculty (especially module co
 ordinators) gets a spot on campus. You can roam around and approach them wi
 th questions.</li><li>We will have “breakout sessions” for special topics (
 e.g. general SE assembly\, foundation\, OS transition special\, ID LU Spotl
 ights)</li></ul>
