DESCRIPTION:Hey party people!<br><br>The time has come to celebrate all tha
 t we have done over the past semester!<br><br>We are excited to invite you 
 to our CODE Semester Closing Party!<br><br><ul style=""><li style=""><b sty
 le="font-weight: bold\;">When</b><span style="font-weight: bold\;">?&nbsp\;
 </span><i style="">Tuesday 17 December 2019 20:00&nbsp\;- 4:00</i></li><li 
 style=""><b style="font-weight: bold\;">Where</b><span style="font-weight: 
 bold\;">?&nbsp\;</span><i style="">Mein Haus am See\, Rosenthaler Platz</i>
 </li><li style=""><b style="font-weight: bold\;">Plus</b><span style="font-
 weight: bold\;">?&nbsp\;</span><i style="">Plus 1's &amp\; 2's are welcome!
  We will send out a link for you to register yourself and your guests.</i><
 /li><li style=""><b style="font-weight: bold\;">Drinks?</b><span style="fon
 t-weight: bold\;">&nbsp\;</span><i style="">You will get drink coupons!</i>
 </li></ul>Come dance the night away with all the party people.&nbsp\;<b>Mor
 e details to follow on Slack!</b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222301Z
LOCATION:Brunnenstraße 197-198\, 10119 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: CODE Semester Closing Party
