 cil: Legal Entity&nbsp\;</b>- To make the establishment of student initiati
 ves easier\, the student council is working towards a CODE Initiatives GmbH
  functioning as a legal entity to manage all legal requirements for our clu
 bs. The student council will present an update and is looking for a managin
 g director.<br></li><li><b>Discussions - Demo and Expo Day</b>: Do we actua
 lly need it? How often should it be? What do you actually want?</li></ol>
