DESCRIPTION:\nWe will meet at the Frontdesk on Monday @ 9.15 am. In case of
  problems don't hesitate to give me a call.\n\nBest\n\nEric\n\n\nWHAT IS HA
 CK WEEK?\n\nHack Week is a week focused on customer obsession and experimen
 tation where we zoom-out and re-imagine how things work. We focus on innova
 tive ideas that lead our business forward and strengthen our culture of col
 laboration. The best Hack Week projects win one of the prestigious awards. 
 The most promising projects with a passionate team have a chance to go beyo
 nd Hack Week and bring the idea to the next level\, thanks to Slingshot​.\n
 \n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/opp-uvix-dbr
 \nOr dial: (DE) +49 30 300195060 PIN: 3358801656532#\nMore phone numbers: h
 ttps://tel.meet/opp-uvix-dbr?pin=3358801656532&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Mee
 t at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not ed
 it this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
