UID:7oh2faqjthmtlukh0m79aiihnl@google.com
CREATED:20190521T122415Z
DESCRIPTION:Event Name: 30 Minute Counseling\nDate & Time: 16:15 - 16:45 (C
 entral European Time) on Thursday\, May 23\, 2019\n\nWhy do you want to mee
 t?:\n  During this last semester I went through a separation.Due the stress
  of living together\, plus CODE's fast paste\, I must admit I fell into not
  so  healthy habits.\n  I am reaching out now because I am being sponsored 
 and given the chance to start an intensive Developer Bootcamp for 3 months\
 ,  while at the same time I might be dealing with lawyers\, for finishing t
 he house contract\, maybe having to find a place\, being unemployed and a l
 ot of factors that could pick my anxiety\, stress and fall back into bad ha
 bits.\n  I would not like to  jeopardise this opportunity and If I am reach
 ing out now is because I must surrender to this feelings\,  while at the sa
 me time\, struggle to recover from a Narcissit partner\, that is aiming to 
 make it complicated for me. \n  I hope this can give you a good overall ide
 a of my situation during these last 6 months. \n  I am looking forward to s
 tart the conversation with you. \n\nNeed to make changes to this event?\nCa
 ncel: https://calendly.com/cancellations/HBE2YBSV5C6FU2KT\nReschedule: http
 s://calendly.com/reschedulings/HBE2YBSV5C6FU2KT\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20190523T143442Z
LOCATION:PHP
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:30 Minute Counseling with Lynn Weinholz
