UID:b97kuj9p6os3ac9m6go3gchj91s70qq470pm4kb3e4mmatj19lhjeh2betrg
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;CN=David 
 Caballero;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20250409T153112Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic: The New Frontier in Remote Behavioral Research\nDescript
 ion: Remote behavioral research combines the convenience of online methods 
 with the depth and precision of in-lab tools. Researchers can explore atten
 tion\, as well as the expression and intensity of participants’ emotions\, 
 by making small adjustments to their existing data collection processes. By
  integrating web cameras and microphones with participant surveys\, this ap
 proach offers a flexible\, scalable\, and cost-effective way to gain deeper
  insights into participant experiences\, without the need for expensive har
 dware.\n\nIn this webinar\, iMotions experts Jessica Wilson\, PhD and Franc
 esca Marchionne\, PhD will explore remote behavioral research opportunities
  for:\nResearchers experienced with online surveys who are looking to gain 
 deeper insights into non-conscious behaviors using biosignals.\nResearchers
  with existing behavioral research labs interested in expanding their work 
 to an online format.\n\nThey will discuss how to capture attention and emot
 ional insights using web cameras and microphones\, covering techniques such
  as eye tracking\, facial expression analysis\, voice analysis\, and respir
 ation metrics. The session will also feature real-world examples of how res
 earchers are using iMotions for remote studies.\n\nBy the end of the webina
 r\, you will:\nUnderstand the value of remote behavioral research\, whether
  you're already using surveys and want more in-depth insights or you're exp
 erienced with behavioral research techniques and want to scale your work on
 line.\nLearn how to measure attention\, emotion\, and arousal through web c
 ameras and microphones.\nDiscover how the iMotions RDC platform enables sea
 mless multimodal remote behavioral research.\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, iPad\,
  or Android:\nhttps://zoom.us/w/96851640823?tk=6JaZ07OPwjENga5rbpURB3YjB352
 ohchJQumbZPHym8.DQcAAAAWjM7B9xZIeHBrRDgzYlFjcS1ldmFNYzdES3d3AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
 AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA&uuid=WN_uf40xcujQhGaqsBiJPcMIQ\n\nPhone one-tap:\n
 +13863475053\,\,96851640823# US\n+15074734847\,\,96851640823# US\n\nJoin vi
 a audio:\n+1 386 347 5053 US\n+1 507 473 4847 US\n+1 564 217 2000 US\n+1 64
 6 931 3860 US\n+1 669 444 9171 US\n+1 669 900 6833 US (San Jose)\n+1 689 27
 8 1000 US\n+1 719 359 4580 US\n+1 929 205 6099 US (New York)\n+1 253 205 04
 68 US\n+1 253 215 8782 US (Tacoma)\n+1 301 715 8592 US (Washington DC)\n+1 
 305 224 1968 US\n+1 309 205 3325 US\n+1 312 626 6799 US (Chicago)\n+1 346 2
 48 7799 US (Houston)\n+1 360 209 5623 US\nWebinar ID: 968 5164 0823\nIntern
 ational numbers available: https://zoom.us/u/aeESMuI6jh\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20250428T072717Z
