ORGANIZER;CN=c_723d6a6a122d1f91682b6aa468524fde466cdafa562e9bd53b37f08213a0
 07ee@group.calendar.google.com:mailto:c_723d6a6a122d1f91682b6aa468524fde466
 cdafa562e9bd53b37f08213a007ee@group.calendar.google.com
UID:1gir2c86r6r9hej634vc09ilhs@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=DECLINED;CN=david.
 caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20250123T085209Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr"><b>Day 1 Agenda (25th January - 11AM EST onwards) 
 :</b></p><p dir="ltr"><b><i>🚨Recordings will not be provided because this 
 is a completely online experience with immersive activities🚨</i></b></p><p
  dir="ltr"><b>Here is the agenda of the First Half of the day:</b></p><p di
 r="ltr"><b>- Generative AI Fundamentals:</b> Dive into the core principles 
 of Generative AI.</p><p dir="ltr"><b>- Prompt Engineering:</b> Learn the ar
 t and science of designing effective prompts to get the best AI outputs.</p
 ><p dir="ltr">- <b>Hands-on Activity:</b> Using the concepts of prompt engi
 neering\, you’ll work on building a simple AI-driven App in real-time.</p><
 p dir="ltr"><b><u>Lunch</u></b></p><p dir="ltr"><b>Here is the agenda of th
 e Second Half of the day:</b></p><p dir="ltr"><b>- Image Generation &amp\; 
 Diffusion Models:</b> Explore the science behind diffusion models and how t
 hey are used in modern AI image generation.</p><p dir="ltr"><b>- Tools Expl
 oration:</b> Play with popular AI platforms like Midjourney and RunwayML to
  create stunning visual content.</p><p dir="ltr"><b>- Project: </b>Apply wh
 at you’ve learned to build a final AI-generated video using image generatio
 n and video editing techniques.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250125T160355Z
LOCATION:Joining Link: https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/6xhv6iv5Qsm
 Xx6MI2NJWMw 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Day 1 of 2 Day AI Mastermind Challenge
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
