DESCRIPTION:This **UNOFFICIAL** YC Alumni Demo Day features companies who h
 ave graduated from YC - the 6 best startups raising the most competitive ro
 unds.\n\n**You'll have the opportunity to invest with a check as small as $
 1\,000 alongside top-tier co-investors.**\n\nYCombinator is an American tec
 hnology startup accelerator that has launched companies including Stripe\, 
 Airbnb\, Cruise\, PagerDuty\, DoorDash\, Coinbase\, Instacart\, Dropbox\, T
 witch\, Flightfox\, and Reddit\n\n**What's a Stonks Demo Day?**\n\nStonks h
 as presented opportunities to co-invest on the same terms as funds/angels l
 ike Sequoia\, Tiger Global\, Vitalik Buterin\, Hustle Fund and many more.\n
 \n**[Check out our highlight video on Youtube](https://youtu.be/xHJrblS-JyU
 )**\n\n(It's madness)\n\n**Min Check Size : $1\,000**\n\n“THIS EVENT IS NOT
  AFFILIATED WITH YCOMBINATOR”\n\nTo join the event click here: https://ston
 ks.com/yc-alumni/dd3
LAST-MODIFIED:20220906T165416Z
LOCATION:https://stonks.com/yc-alumni/dd3
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:(Unofficial) YC Alumni Demo Day 3
TRANSP:OPAQUE
