 caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
CREATED:20230109T115428Z
DESCRIPTION:This a Pre-Kick-Off week Projects and Pre-Loved Projects Fair w
 hich will give teams the opportunity to hold interest meetings in rooms in 
 order to find teammates before Kick-Off week\n\nIt is also an opportunity f
 or students who are still looking for a team to join to meet with potential
  team members. \n\nIt will be a very relaxed event\, where Lizard and Sciss
 ors will be available to you to bring your laptop and try to recruit teamma
 tes or find teams to join. \n\nTeams do not have to provide slides or pitch
  your project idea like during Kick-Off week. Rather\, just be present in t
 he room with your project and lots of enthusiasm! \n\nFor the Pre-Loved Pro
 jects\, if there is a project that you would like to pass on\, this is a gr
 eat opportunity for you to hand over your project to new potential owners!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230124T123235Z
LOCATION:--4-Scissors (25)\, --4-Paper (25)
