DESCRIPTION:\nAll times this LU is taking place\nFri 07.09. 09-17h \nFri 08
 .09. 09-17h \nFri 28.09. 09-17h \nFri 29.09. 09-17h\n\nLecturer\nJennifer K
 röger\n\nBlurb\nAn introduction of Brand Development and Brand Design from 
 yesterday\, todays and tomorrows perspective. The course is focused on the 
 main megatrends like digitalization and globalization and the impact for br
 ands in this digital and global environment. The changes in our communicati
 ve behaviors and cultural structures change brands. And the amount of diffe
 rent brands on the market\, with new retail channels\, are complex challeng
 es and new chances for designers to be managed.\n\nStudent Host\nGianluca C
 orpino\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222525Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LU_30 Brand Design
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
