ORGANIZER;CN=charlotte.hook@factoryberlin.com:mailto:charlotte.hook@factory
 berlin.com
UID:4kkkk9buo01gh3a26ibci1qls2@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=da
 vid.caballero@code.berlin;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:david.caballero@code.berlin
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/obj-mjtr-vmg
CREATED:20220607T153349Z
DESCRIPTION:As it’s Pride Month\, Factory Berlin is giving a platform and v
 isibility to queer founders and innovators from our community - and we’ve s
 elected you as a founder who we would love to spotlight through these effor
 ts.<br><b>&nbsp\;<br>We’d like to invite you to give a 3 to 5 minute pitch 
 of your startup at this week’s Happy Hour and to feature you and your compa
 ny on Factory Berlin’s social media.&nbsp\;</b>We expect the reach of the e
 vent and the social media and internal communications coverage to be the fo
 llowing:&nbsp\;<br><ul><li>Event Attendance: 60 - 80 PAX (Members &amp\; In
 vited Guests only)</li><li>Instagram: 25.8 K followers</li><li>LinkedIn: 15
  K followers</li><li>Twitter: 24.7 followers</li><li>Newsletter: 2500+ read
 ers</li></ul><br>I've copied in&nbsp\;the key details for the activation be
 low. Please check it out and let us know if you are able to join us onstage
  on Thursday in Factory Berlin Görlitzer Park. :) I’ll go ahead and send a 
 calendar invite for you to check your availability.&nbsp\;<br>Thanks and ha
 ve a lovely day.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Best\,<br>Charlotte<br><br><br><b>Pride Feat
 ure Info - Happy Hour + Social Coverage</b><br><b>Timing &amp\; Location:</
 b><br><b>Thursday June 9th 2022 @ Factory Berlin Görlitzer Park &nbsp\;<br>
 <ul><li><b>16:00 - 17:30: Film &amp\; Photography Shooting</b></li><li><b>1
 7:30 - 19:00: Pitches at Happy Hour&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b></li></ul></b><b>More 
 about the Event</b><br><blockquote><br>In this special Pride edition of Hap
 py Hour sponsored by Sips\, we will be spotlighting 2SLGBTQIA+ founders and
  community members as we relax\, have some drinks\, and get to know each ot
 her.</blockquote><blockquote><br>Each founder has 5-minutes to give an info
 rmal pitch about their startup or project to the community. There will be a
  screen for them to have a presentation if needed.</blockquote><blockquote>
 <br><b>Format:</b>&nbsp\;3-minute to 5-minute pitch<br><b>Where:&nbsp\;</b>
 Live Event at Factory Görlitzer Park</blockquote><br><br><b>More about Soci
 al Media Coverage</b><br><b><br></b><blockquote><br>The &lt\;Actual&gt\; El
 evator Pitch</blockquote><blockquote><br>We all know the importance of an e
 levator pitch - you never know who you may meet\, where you’ll meet them\, 
 and how long you’ll have to pitch your idea. But it’s essential for a found
 er to be prepared for any eventuality.</blockquote><blockquote><br><b>For T
 he &lt\;Actual&gt\; Elevator Pitch\, our founders will get one ride in the 
 elevator to pitch directly to camera\, broadcast to our social media follow
 ers. The content will be posted on our Instagram channel\, and then repurpo
 sed for our other channels\, including the community newsletter\, and campu
 s screens.</b></blockquote><blockquote><br><b>Format: 30-60s video\, Instag
 ram Reel</b><br><b>Where: Hosted on Factory Berlin Instagram Channels + cro
 ssposted</b></blockquote><blockquote><br><br>The Photo Interview</blockquot
 e><blockquote><br>We’re taking the traditional Q&amp\;A interview format\, 
 and turning it upside down.<b>&nbsp\;We’ll ask our founders to tell their s
 tory\, and answer our questions\, with photos. Either curated from their ca
 mera roll\, their archive photos\, or from what we can scour on the interne
 t.</b></blockquote><blockquote><br>Posted as a carousel of images\, with th
 e question in graphics over each image\, we slide through to get to know th
 e person we’re talking to. The post copy will give a deeper picture\, elabo
 rating on the quotes/answers\, and explaining the person and their company.
 </blockquote><blockquote><br><b>Format: Static image carousel\, with some g
 raphic elements (key quotes\, name + logo)</b><br><b>Where: Hosted on Facto
 ry Berlin Instagram\, LinkedIn + Twitter channels + crossposted</b></blockq
 uote>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/obj-m
 jtr-vmg\nOr dial: (US) +1 252-572-1707 PIN: 248141897#\nMore phone numbers:
  https://tel.meet/obj-mjtr-vmg?pin=5473191943625&hs=7\n\nLearn more about M
 eet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not 
 edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
