DESCRIPTION:Let's gather for some fun :)&nbsp\;<br>──────────<br><br><b>&nb
 sp\;A nice collection of smaller events offered by us and some students&nbs
 p\;</b><br><br>Whether it be online (another Remote Cooking session (after 
 Manuel’s amazing feedback)\, a GinTonic &amp\; Chat or a game) or in real l
 ife (Play one round of spikeball in the park\, beer garden\, bouldering)&nb
 sp\;And the best: You can still add events!&nbsp\;<br><br>Do you have somet
 hing in mind you want to offer for the community? Feel free to add it in th
 e spreadsheet until Monday at 2 pm.Here is the spreadsheet\, just sign in a
 nd Britta and Selma will do their magic: putting you in a channel with your
  host - whoop whoop:<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1fC
 eKgY7Lip0C0WPhCaQU7Oak48WWrc4hYwqBUFeQl1M/edit#gid=0">https://docs.google.c
 om/spreadsheets/d/1fCeKgY7Lip0C0WPhCaQU7Oak48WWrc4hYwqBUFeQl1M/edit#gid=0</
 a><br><br><b>Please make sure to sign-up until Monday 2pm</b> - and it’s fi
 rst come first serve\, so choose fast&nbsp\;
