DESCRIPTION:Dear team and working students\, \n\n\nthe summer break is comi
 ng to an end and we would like to organize a team BBQ as a thank you for th
 e work you have done to prepare CODE for the next semester.\n\nNo need to b
 ring anything. Dogs and family members /friends are welcome :). Please reac
 t to see how much we need to buy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222540Z
LOCATION:Schlesischer Busch 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:"We say thank you"-BBQ
