 r 7th\, from 12 to 1PM and we will discuss topics concerning the whole stud
 ent body as well as changes in our statute. \n\nThe elections of the studen
 t council will happen afterwards (from 1PM to 8PM) via Slack. A detailed ag
 enda will follow by Monday.\n\nBest\,\nThe current Student Council.
