DESCRIPTION:Let’s continue our conversation about how we can bring the CODE
  community together and increase feelings of Inclusion for EVERYONE — even 
 though different people have different perspectives\, experiences\, values 
 and concerns.\n\n\nThe focus of this meeting is what can we each do differe
 ntly and what can we all do together to help create a CODE community where 
 all feel respected and included and where every student can thrive. Bring y
 our curiosity\, your positive mindset\, your trust in others’ good intentio
 ns\, and your great ideas!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230106T222630Z
LOCATION:(Seminar Room)-CODE Campus-4-Scissors (25)
